e,"reward":false,"firstImg":"https://xqimg.imedao.com/188afdf369a8963fecf7248a.jpeg","rawTitle":"想报考财经大学？刚刚！2023年财经院校最新排行榜公布！","tagStr":"","longTextForIOS":false,"topic_pic_thumbnail_small":null,"topic_pic_thumbnail":null,"topic_pic_headOrPad":null,"tagsForWeb":";","reply_count":0,"meta_keywords":"{\"ip_location\":\"北京\"}","paid_mention":null,"reward_count":0,"reward_amount":0,"reward_user_count":0,"talk_count":0,"like_count":1,"video_info":null,"quote_cards":null,"promotion_pic":null,"promotion_url":null,"promotion_id":0,"mark_desc":null,"pic_sizes":[{"width":1024,"height":948},{"width":1024,"height":589},{"width":666,"height":3374}],"cover_pic_size":null,"order_id":0,"tags":[],"status_industry":null,"excellent_comments":[],"notice_tag":null,"common_emotion":null,"current_stock_price":null,"new_card":null,"source_deep_link":null,"source_feed":false,"editable":true,"like_config":null,"title_ad_pic":null,"title_ad_url":null,"title_ad_deep_link":null,"answer_comment":null,"answer_count":0,"answer_users":null,"bonus_screen_name":null,"fundx_tag":null,"extend_st_feed_info":{"stock_event_time":0,"stock_event_type":null,"change_event_color":null,"is_future_event":false,"stock_event_id":null,"stock_event_message":null,"original_text_length":926,"disputed_status":false,"excellent_status":"false"},"stock_list":null,"reply_user_images":null,"reply_user_count":0,"fundx_symbol":null,"hot_new_rank":null,"image_info_list":[{"filename":"188afdf369a8963fecf7248a.jpeg","width":1024,"height":948,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"188afdf2ef692ef3fe02ab67.jpeg","width":1024,"height":589,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"188afdf3eca92f03fe0c1fd7.jpeg","width":666,"height":3374,"ocr_result":null}],"extend_st_home_page":{"ip_location":"北京","st_mention_stock_count":0,"ai_card":null,"ai_status":false,"speech_enable":false,"speech_info":null},"censor_state":0,"recommend_cards":null,"forbidden_retweet":false,"text":"<p><b>注：因为公众号平台更改了推送规则，如果不想错过</b><b>马靖昊说会计</b><b>的文章，记得将我们设为</b><b>“星标”</b><b>，这样每次新文章推送才会第一时间出现在您的订阅列表里。</b></p> <p><b>方法</b> 点击页面左上角蓝色<b>马靖昊说会计</b>进入主页，再点主页右上角<b>&#34;...&#34;</b><b>，</b>然后选择<b>“设为星标”</b>（账号旁显示五角星标记表示成功）。</p> <p><b><b>福利：文末扫码填写问卷后参加抽奖，包邮赠8本马靖昊签名版《会计之道》</b></b></p> <p>2023年高考刚刚过去，在今年这个特殊年份，考生和家长都比较紧张，期待考个好成绩，报个好学校。</p> <p><b>财经类大学一直以来都是经久不衰的一类报考热门院校，</b><b>今天就介绍一下我国财经类大学</b><b>。</b>财经类院校，是指以财经类专业为主要学科的院校。国内著名的财经类院校有<b>中央财经大学</b>、<b>对外经济贸易大学、上海财经大学、西南财经大学、中南财经政法大学等等。</b></p> <p>根据中国科教评价网最新发布的《2022-2023年财经类大学排名》，中央财经大学排名第一，上海财经大学，西南财经大学，对外经济贸易大学，中南财经政法大学紧随其后。</p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/188afdf369a8963fecf7248a.jpeg\" /></p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/188afdf2ef692ef3fe02ab67.jpeg\" /></p> <p>与此同时，软科也公布了2023年财经大学排名。2023软科中国财经类大学排名的上榜高校有<b>55</b>所，<b>上海财经大学、中央财经大学、对外经济贸易大学、中南财经政法大学、西南财经大学</b>位列前五，“五财一贸”就牢牢锁定在前六。</p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/188afdf3eca92f03fe0c1fd7.jpeg\" /><b>任何排名都伴有巨大争议，大家仅供参考，不必过于纠结。</b></p>  <p>用精炼的语言阐述深刻的财务逻辑，如文章得到您的认可，<b>希望您看完后分享到“朋友圈”或者点一下右下角的“在看”，</b>以示鼓励。长期坚持不易，多次想放弃，坚持是一种信仰，专注是一种态度 ，一路陪伴，一起地老天荒，谢谢。</p>  <p><b>推荐阅读</b></p> <p><b>现金循环周期揭示了管理资产负债表的重要意义！</b></p> <p>【周末荐读】时间，教会了我6个道理！</p> <p>财务、会计以及审计的区别！</p> <p>上市公司只要财务造假，总能从细节处发现</p> <p>现金流量表是如何造假的？</p> <p><b>颜值本身绝对是一项资产！！！</b></p> <p>*ST紫晶欺诈发行解读：“体外担保术”造假！</p> <p>应收账款周转率</p> <p>未分配利润的分析</p> <p><b>这两个会计连吵架都吵得这么专业，我服！</b></p>","show_cover_pic":true,"legal_user_visible":false,"is_column":false,"is_answer":false,"is_refused":false,"is_ss_multi_pic":false,"is_bonus":false,"cover_pic":"","vod_info":null,"pic":"https://xqimg.imedao.com/188afdf369a8963fecf7248a.jpeg,https://xqimg.imedao.com/188afdf2ef692ef3fe02ab67.jpeg,https://xqimg.imedao.com/188afdf3eca92f03fe0c1fd7.jpeg","answer_question":false,"is_no_archive":false,"is_original_declare":false,"mp_not_show_status":false,"forbidden_comment":false,"is_private":false}